\Method{\EXP{\VAR{toString}()\COLON \TYP{String}}}

The \VAR{toString} method returns either \EXP{\hbox{\rm``{\tt LessThan}''}} or \EXP{\hbox{\rm``{\tt EqualTo}''}}

